## 🛡️ COMPLIANCE IMPLEMENTATION GUIDELINES

### Pre-Public Use Checklist

Before making any content publicly available, verify:

- [ ] Content has explicit public distribution authorization
- [ ] All rights holders have consented to public use
- [ ] Rights management information is preserved
- [ ] Opt-out mechanisms are implemented and respected
- [ ] Cross-border portability compliance is ensured
- [ ] Terms of use and copyright notices are displayed
- [ ] User authentication and access controls are in place
- [ ] Regular compliance monitoring is established

### Public Use Monitoring Requirements

Implement continuous monitoring for:

- [ ] Rights holder authorization compliance
- [ ] Opt-out mechanism respect
- [ ] Cross-border portability compliance
- [ ] Rights management information preservation
- [ ] User access and authentication
- [ ] Commercial use restrictions
- [ ] Attribution and source citation
- [ ] Technical protection respect

### Regular Compliance Reviews

Conduct monthly reviews of:

- [ ] All indexed content licensing and authorization
- [ ] Rights holder opt-out compliance
- [ ] Public access controls and user management
- [ ] Cross-border portability implementation
- [ ] Rights management information integrity
- [ ] Commercial use restrictions compliance
- [ ] Attribution and citation accuracy
- [ ] Technical protection compliance

